  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aawaz II: Inclusion, Accountability and Preventing Modern Slavery -  Salaries for Programme Funded Staff</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusion Team of the Governance and Inclusion Group runs one programme named Aawaz II. Some of the staff salaries come from the programme budget whereas, the other staff are paid from the normal admin budgets. This component is used for making payment of salaries to the programme funded staff.</narrative>
  </description>
